{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055402120904784","content":"Once Skitter has left, Web turns to Wren. \"Knights have records, Masonic stones and markings from defeat of hunger long ago. Markings indicate that old masons deliberately let hunger live and cycle continue, still others that point to actively maintaining hunger's power. Web do not wish to speak for others, but know that I wish hunger defeated for good. Knights plan to defeat hunger involves ritual powered by Knights artifacts. Many knights must be present, each wielding an artifact. Ritual will trap hunger on this plain, preventing from re-forming in abyss. Knights also wish to return divine spark of defeated gods to the world using artifacts. This would happen after hunger defeated. Main conflict with old Masons comes from Masons believing more divinity will invite more evil gods. Web think that it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T06:03:47.898000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744073840916824096","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"739055402120904784","content":"She nods, taking it all in. “I agree that the Hunger must be bound and defeated in this plane. We will work with the Knights to accomplish this. Once that happens, I’m not sure what to do. I believe that the presence of gods, even good ones, especially good ones, opens the door to evil gods.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T06:07:51.027000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744074860673630278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"739055402120904784","content":"She takes a deep breath","created_at":"2020-08-15T06:08:03.139000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744074911475040296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"739055402120904784","content":"“So that is where I differ from the Knights. I’m not sure where everyone else stands but that is where the Archivist is at.”","created_at":"2020-08-15T06:08:34.375000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744075042488582175","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
